            <Title>Bangladesh Traffic Signs Dataset</Title>
            <Description>This dataset consists of traffic sign images collected from Bangladesh, capturing both Bengali signage commonly found on roads. It includes multiple categories such as regulatory, warning, and informational signs, reflecting real-world driving environments. The images are taken under diverse conditions, including different lighting, weather, angles, and levels of occlusion, making the dataset suitable for robust model training. This dataset is designed to support tasks such as image classification, object detection, and multilingual traffic sign recognition, and can be used for research and development in computer vision and intelligent transportation systems.</Description>
